<p class="sub" style="text-align:center">HOW WE HANDLE YOUR INFORMATION</p>
<p>At Newds.Co, your privacy is important to us. We are committed to safeguarding your personal information and ensuring it is used responsibly.</p>
<h3 style="font-size:13px;letter-spacing:3px;margin-top:24px">INFORMATION WE COLLECT</h3>
<ul style="margin-top:8px;font-size:14px;line-height:2">
<li>Shipping and billing address</li>
<li>Payment details (processed securely via payment gateways)</li>
<li>Order history and preferences</li>
</ul>
<h3 style="font-size:13px;letter-spacing:3px;margin-top:24px">HOW WE USE YOUR INFORMATION</h3>
<ul style="margin-top:8px;font-size:14px;line-height:2">
<li>To process and deliver your orders</li>
<li>To send order updates via email or WhatsApp</li>
<li>To improve our products and services</li>
<li>To provide customer support</li>
</ul>
<p style="margin-top:16px">We implement appropriate security measures to protect your personal information against unauthorized access, alteration, or destruction.</p>
<p style="margin-top:8px">If you have any questions about our privacy practices, please contact us via WhatsApp or email at newds.co@gmail.com.</p>
